What do I have to do?


00:47:36.796 --> 00:47:40.006
The corsican fruit, stage two.


00:47:46.650 --> 00:47:48.052
Mmm!


00:47:49.423 --> 00:47:51.023
Mmm!


00:47:51.094 --> 00:47:53.897
Oh, my God. That's like a
lusciousness of lemon and lime.


00:47:53.964 --> 00:47:55.666
It's like a symphony of citrus.


