00:56:56.681 --> 00:57:01.021
The next stage.
You're becoming me.


00:57:01.083 --> 00:57:04.159
I don't want to be you.
I want to be me.


00:57:05.295 --> 00:57:06.466
I gotta be me.


00:57:06.526 --> 00:57:09.536
Well, well, well, well,


00:57:10.167 --> 00:57:11.439
Well.


00:57:11.510 --> 00:57:13.340
