What?


00:58:47.011 --> 00:58:48.747
I think Zack and Cody may be in danger.


00:58:48.815 --> 00:58:50.735
Oh, no! It could be a
matter of life or death.


00:58:50.804 --> 00:58:52.612
Those are two really different choices.


00:58:52.668 --> 00:58:54.735
Bailey,
call Mr. Moseby,


00:58:54.793 --> 00:58:57.939
Tell him to meet us at the gemini
project on the new old sawmill road.


00:59:04.416 --> 00:59:07.444
So. You know
about the merge.


00:59:10.248 --> 00:59:11.879
And apparently, you've
discovered the next phase.


00:59:12.840 --> 00:59:14.082
The hive mind.


00:59:14.153 --> 00:59:15.903
Groundbreaking research.


00:59:15.974 --> 00:59:17.966
You know, I'd really love to
stick around and talk about it.


00:59:18.036 --> 00:59:19.414
Stick around and talk about it.


