00:59:43.497 --> 00:59:45.162
<i>Yeah.</i>


00:59:45.232 --> 00:59:46.630
<i>Cool, right?</i>


00:59:46.693 --> 00:59:48.062
<i>So cool.</i>


00:59:48.132 --> 00:59:50.295
