Apparently, stage four must
commence earlier than planned.


01:01:00.807 --> 01:01:02.404
Quick! This way!


01:01:13.236 --> 01:01:15.342
Where are you going, Zack and Cody?


01:01:15.403 --> 01:01:17.472
Where are you going, Zack and Cody?


